<section class="section"><div class="container prose"><h2>What the catalogue does</h2><p>The third-quarter 2026 catalogue identifies certain occupations which, when the full requirements are met, can support an initial temporary residence and work authorisation for an employee.</p><h2>What still needs checking</h2><ul><li>The precise occupation.</li><li>The applicable territory.</li><li>The job and its conditions.</li><li>The remaining authorisation requirements.</li></ul><p><a href="https://www.boe.es/diario_boe/txt.php?id=BOE-A-2026-18504" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the official resolution at the BOE →</a></p></div></section><CTA title="Hiring a foreign national?" text="We can review whether the role, occupation and documentation fit the available route." label="Contact the firm" /></Layout>
